    "original_ingredient_text": "Key Ingredients PDRN · EGF · Volufiline · Peptides PDRN 12%EGFVolufilineLiposome Key Ingredients: PDRN 120,000 ppm, Sodium DNA, phyto PDRN, Niacinamide 20,000 ppm, Volufiline, EGF, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Ceramide, Panthenol and Hyaluronic Acid Complex. Technology: Liposome encapsulation for an elegant serum delivery story. Texture: Lightweight, non-sticky and fast-absorbing. Refer to the product packaging for the complete and most current ingredient list. For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if persistent irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.",
